WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 11=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.512
(Enter the Palace to Meet His Majesty)

00:43.012 --> 00:44.837
(Juzhen Glaze Workshop)

00:45.040 --> 00:46.319
I already knew.

00:46.450 --> 00:48.320
My men said someone
is planning to impeach you.

00:48.320 --> 00:49.280
Keep an eye on it.

00:49.360 --> 00:50.400
You even know that?

00:50.400 --> 00:51.679
Your sources are pretty sharp.

00:51.679 --> 00:53.279
We have been
in the Great Yong for years.

00:53.279 --> 00:55.000
We have our own connections.

00:55.199 --> 00:56.160
All these years,

00:56.170 --> 00:58.279
the great clans have been trying
to get into the steppe trade,

00:58.279 --> 00:59.679
and they have been squeezing us out.

00:59.760 --> 01:00.879
We refused.

01:01.320 --> 01:03.480
Without the Hu merchants,

01:03.490 --> 01:04.640
there would be no way
to bring back news from the steppe

01:04.640 --> 01:06.160
to the Great Yong.

01:09.559 --> 01:11.920
So people actually
come to you to gather information?

01:12.120 --> 01:13.160
Not really.

01:13.160 --> 01:15.079
It is just that the border troops

01:15.079 --> 01:16.880
sometimes ask us
about what we have seen,

01:16.880 --> 01:18.119
and we tell them a bit of what

01:18.119 --> 01:19.079
we know.

01:19.200 --> 01:20.640
But we never tell everything.

01:20.759 --> 01:22.960
If Beicang or the other tribes find out,

01:22.960 --> 01:24.119
we would not survive it.

01:24.640 --> 01:26.920
(This is part of how they stay afloat.)

01:27.240 --> 01:28.479
(It makes sense.)

01:31.000 --> 01:32.860
I am heading back
to the steppe to deliver goods.

01:35.200 --> 01:36.119
Leaving already?

01:36.600 --> 01:38.560
In such a hurry
to make money off Beicang?

01:40.039 --> 01:41.240
You know me well.

01:42.399 --> 01:44.560
Then you must come
visit me on the steppe.

01:51.879 --> 01:52.640
Duo the Fool.

01:52.640 --> 01:53.390
What are you doing?

01:55.719 --> 01:56.599
Wei the Fool.

01:56.760 --> 01:57.879
Take care of yourself.

01:58.319 --> 01:59.760
I am off.

02:01.319 --> 02:02.120
Stay safe.

02:20.480 --> 02:21.400
If

02:21.920 --> 02:25.120
the court secretly formed
a merchant caravan

02:25.640 --> 02:27.000
to trade in Beicang

02:27.000 --> 02:28.550
and gather intelligence
at the same time,

02:29.519 --> 02:31.159
would that work?

02:32.319 --> 02:33.120
No,

02:33.319 --> 02:35.359
maybe the Great Yong
is already doing it.

02:35.359 --> 02:36.599
If I can think of it,

02:36.599 --> 02:38.290
how could His Majesty
not have thought of it?

02:38.319 --> 02:39.120
Wei the Fool.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.359
You startled me.

02:42.359 --> 02:43.879
What are you sneaking around for?

02:44.640 --> 02:46.799
How dare you speak
to this princess like that?

02:49.159 --> 02:49.959
Hungry?

02:50.079 --> 02:51.290
Let us go to Juxian Restaurant.

02:53.199 --> 02:54.840
I have something to tell you.

02:55.240 --> 02:56.280
Tomorrow morning,

02:56.520 --> 02:58.599
you are entering
the palace to meet my father.

02:59.400 --> 03:00.319
So suddenly?

03:00.319 --> 03:01.199
Tomorrow?

03:03.360 --> 03:05.120
I am not ready.

03:05.520 --> 03:06.680
What is there to prepare?

03:06.719 --> 03:07.680
A gift.

03:07.680 --> 03:08.800
I cannot go empty handed.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.400
No, I have to head back.

03:10.599 --> 03:11.840
I am not done yet.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.439
Tomorrow morning,

03:14.520 --> 03:16.240
whatever you see,

03:16.400 --> 03:17.800
do not act too surprised.

03:19.879 --> 03:20.680
You little trickster,

03:21.360 --> 03:22.680
you are hiding something from me.

03:22.680 --> 03:23.319
Say it.

03:24.080 --> 03:25.719
I am hiding something.

03:25.719 --> 03:26.879
Figure it out yourself.

03:27.599 --> 03:28.919
Why are you doing this?

03:28.920 --> 03:30.100
How am I supposed to respond?

03:30.400 --> 03:31.199
Tomorrow,

03:31.199 --> 03:32.639
you must behave well.

03:32.639 --> 03:33.599
Do not speak out of turn,

03:33.599 --> 03:34.639
and do not wander around.

03:34.639 --> 03:35.680
That is the imperial palace.

03:35.680 --> 03:37.120
If you wander,
you will get into trouble.

03:37.120 --> 03:37.800
And one more thing,

03:37.800 --> 03:38.759
even if you are unhappy,

03:38.759 --> 03:40.319
do not show it. Understand?

03:43.039 --> 03:44.240
Do not worry.

03:45.310 --> 03:47.570
Do you think I would speak carelessly
before His Majesty?

03:47.919 --> 03:49.039
Once I meet His Majesty,

03:49.039 --> 03:51.439
I will make you go
from a fallen princess

03:51.440 --> 03:53.190
to the most favored one
in the inner palace.

04:24.439 --> 04:25.599
Hao.

04:25.599 --> 04:26.520
Wake up.

04:26.880 --> 04:27.240
Get up.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.860
Let me sleep a bit longer.
I am exhausted.

04:28.879 --> 04:29.599
Sleep?

04:29.599 --> 04:31.199
You are entering the palace
to meet His Majesty today.

04:31.199 --> 04:32.479
Get up.

04:34.439 --> 04:35.240
What?

04:35.280 --> 04:36.719
Are you out of your mind?

04:37.319 --> 04:38.879
What is His Majesty thinking?

04:38.880 --> 04:41.320
How is he supposed to run the empire
if he cannot even sleep properly?

04:41.330 --> 04:42.159
Do not talk nonsense.

04:42.159 --> 04:42.960
Come on, get down.

04:42.960 --> 04:43.599
Get dressed.

04:43.599 --> 04:44.360
Mister Wang.

04:46.600 --> 04:48.199
You will accompany
the Young Master to the palace today.

04:48.199 --> 04:49.039
Keep an eye on him.

04:49.240 --> 04:49.520
Yes.

04:49.520 --> 04:50.680
Do not let him go around hitting people.

04:50.680 --> 04:51.199
Understood.

04:51.199 --> 04:51.800
Do not worry, Young Madam.

04:51.800 --> 04:52.159
Hurry up.

04:52.159 --> 04:53.950
Making His Majesty
wait is a grave offense.

04:53.960 --> 04:54.479
My shoes.

04:54.479 --> 04:55.039
Coming, coming.

04:55.039 --> 04:55.520
Hurry.

04:55.879 --> 04:56.560
Young Master.

05:23.959 --> 05:24.759
Young Master.

05:25.519 --> 05:26.319
Young Master.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.160
This does not feel right.

05:32.720 --> 05:33.600
Not right?

05:33.720 --> 05:34.759
What is not right?

05:35.360 --> 05:36.439
Look.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.720
Why is there not a single person around?

05:51.480 --> 05:52.279
Mister Wang,

05:52.600 --> 05:53.759
did you get it wrong?

05:53.759 --> 05:54.519
Young Master,

05:54.839 --> 05:56.839
I have been in the capital for decades.

05:57.000 --> 05:58.319
I would not get it wrong.

05:58.639 --> 05:59.759
It is just strange.

06:00.000 --> 06:01.639
Why is there no one here?

06:05.360 --> 06:06.040
Hey,

06:06.319 --> 06:08.439
is this the gate for court attendance?

06:10.160 --> 06:10.959
Hey,

06:11.199 --> 06:11.920
say something.

06:14.160 --> 06:16.120
There is no one here.

06:21.439 --> 06:22.240
Who is it?

06:23.839 --> 06:24.639
Hey.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.519
It is me,

06:26.000 --> 06:27.319
Wei Hao.

06:27.519 --> 06:28.879
Are you on duty here?

06:29.199 --> 06:30.000
No...

06:30.480 --> 06:32.079
Why is there no one around?

06:32.079 --> 06:33.330
There is no court session today.

06:33.839 --> 06:35.240
Why did you come so early?

06:35.600 --> 06:36.639
I came to the palace

06:37.160 --> 06:38.600
to thank His Majesty in person.

06:38.879 --> 06:40.319
Even then, it is not this early.

06:40.639 --> 06:41.959
His Majesty has not gotten up yet.

06:42.079 --> 06:43.480
Not awake yet?

06:43.920 --> 06:44.519
I...

06:45.480 --> 06:45.959
Then...

06:46.519 --> 06:47.639
When will

06:48.160 --> 06:49.519
the gate open?

06:49.720 --> 06:50.639
In two hours.

06:51.480 --> 06:53.399
Why did you come so early anyway?

06:53.439 --> 06:55.000
Your audience is in the morning.

06:55.199 --> 06:56.879
Did the Ministry of Rites
not inform you?

06:56.959 --> 06:58.160
Morning?

07:01.240 --> 07:03.800
Then why did you wake me up so early?

07:04.120 --> 07:04.839
Young Master.

07:05.000 --> 07:07.199
Isn't morning early anyway?

07:07.839 --> 07:08.360
Then...

07:12.120 --> 07:13.199
Can I

07:13.519 --> 07:15.959
go back and get a bit more
sleep before coming again?

07:17.279 --> 07:18.360
Wei the Fool,

07:18.759 --> 07:20.000
you have some nerve.

07:20.010 --> 07:21.519
You have come
but have not seen His Majesty,

07:21.519 --> 07:22.720
and you already want to leave?

07:23.120 --> 07:24.759
Do not say I did not warn you.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.720
If you leave now,

07:26.759 --> 07:27.839
it will be a grave offense.

07:28.519 --> 07:29.360
Aunt,

07:30.160 --> 07:31.480
she set me up again.

07:32.480 --> 07:34.240
I woke up early for nothing.

07:34.720 --> 07:35.759
Unbelievable.

07:38.240 --> 07:38.759
Forget it.

07:38.759 --> 07:39.600
Wait here for me.

07:47.399 --> 07:48.000
Let us go.

07:48.120 --> 07:49.120
I will take you inside.

07:49.130 --> 07:50.590
Since you are entering the palace
to meet His Majesty,

07:51.310 --> 07:53.000
you cannot risk
not being present when he

07:53.000 --> 07:53.759
summons you.

07:54.000 --> 07:54.800
Arriving early

07:54.800 --> 07:56.040
shows sincerity.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.879
Wait outside Ganlu Palace.

08:00.000 --> 08:00.879
When will His Majesty wake up?

08:00.879 --> 08:01.560
Just wait.

08:01.560 --> 08:02.360
Two hours.

08:03.040 --> 08:03.839
What?

08:04.519 --> 08:06.360
Wei the Fool has come to give thanks?

08:07.050 --> 08:08.480
Was it not scheduled for the morning?

08:09.199 --> 08:11.319
I don't know.

08:11.560 --> 08:13.480
He is waiting outside right now.

08:13.600 --> 08:14.639
Let him wait.

08:15.160 --> 08:15.839
Also,

08:15.839 --> 08:17.079
inform the Eldest Princess.

08:17.079 --> 08:17.839
Tell her

08:18.199 --> 08:19.399
Wei the Fool has arrived.

08:19.839 --> 08:21.399
Have her come to Ganlu Palace

08:21.399 --> 08:22.560
in two quarters of an hour.

08:23.560 --> 08:24.720
Not too early.

08:25.040 --> 08:25.839
Yes.

08:26.040 --> 08:27.439
I will see to it right away.

08:28.360 --> 08:30.560
(Did the Ministry of Rites
not make it clear?)

08:31.160 --> 08:31.959
(Otherwise,)

08:32.120 --> 08:34.639
(why would that boy come this early?)

08:35.839 --> 08:37.720
Why is Wei the Fool already here?

08:37.720 --> 08:39.120
How did he even get up that early?

08:39.120 --> 08:41.000
I am not even ready yet.

08:41.000 --> 08:41.480
That fool.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.990
Your Highness,
be careful not to catch a chill.

08:44.480 --> 08:46.160
I wonder what that fool

08:46.439 --> 08:48.319
will look like when he finds out

08:48.959 --> 08:50.639
I am the Eldest Princess.

08:51.839 --> 08:53.759
He will not call me a liar, will he?

08:54.439 --> 08:55.240
Your Highness,

08:55.560 --> 08:56.639
please do not be nervous.

08:56.839 --> 08:57.720
Besides,

08:57.720 --> 09:00.160
have you not already made things clear
with Lord Wei?

09:00.360 --> 09:01.480
Who is nervous?

09:01.480 --> 09:02.680
That fool.

09:03.399 --> 09:04.199
Your Highness,

09:04.319 --> 09:05.600
the eunuch from Ganlu Palace

09:05.600 --> 09:06.639
delivered a message.

09:06.660 --> 09:08.399
You are to go over
in a quarter of an hour.

09:08.439 --> 09:09.519
Do not go too early.

09:10.920 --> 09:13.399
Then I will go back
and get ready a bit more.

09:14.160 --> 09:15.200
Let him wait.

09:23.712 --> 09:25.550
(Ganlu Palace)

09:28.362 --> 09:32.787
(Ganlu Palace)

09:36.639 --> 09:41.720
Summon Wei Hao, Dynasty-Founding
County Lord of Pingyang, to an audience.

09:42.919 --> 09:43.720
That is me.

09:52.279 --> 09:54.120
Hand over any swords or blades

09:54.120 --> 09:54.879
you have.

09:54.879 --> 09:55.840
I do not carry those.

09:55.840 --> 09:56.919
Why would I bring weapons?

09:57.100 --> 09:58.039
I am not here to fight.

09:58.039 --> 09:58.679
Search him.

10:00.600 --> 10:01.990
Are you holding a grudge or something?

10:03.159 --> 10:04.799
Even if the Crown Prince were here,

10:04.810 --> 10:05.519
he would still be searched.

10:05.519 --> 10:06.360
Those are the rules.

10:06.919 --> 10:07.480
Search.

10:10.159 --> 10:10.960
Fine.

10:12.262 --> 10:15.600
(Ganlu Palace)

10:15.600 --> 10:16.399
My Lord,

10:16.440 --> 10:17.480
this way, please.

10:19.039 --> 10:19.759
My Lord,

10:19.759 --> 10:21.080
when you meet His Majesty later,

10:21.080 --> 10:22.720
do not speak loudly.

10:22.720 --> 10:24.039
Mind your etiquette.

10:24.519 --> 10:25.360
Thank you, Eunuch.

10:25.679 --> 10:27.080
I did not bring anything this time.

10:27.120 --> 10:28.639
Next time you come to Juxian Restaurant,

10:28.639 --> 10:29.559
just give my name.

10:29.560 --> 10:30.500
It will be on the house.

10:31.519 --> 10:33.360
(Ganlu Palace)
This way. Over here.

10:33.360 --> 10:33.799
Move.

10:35.320 --> 10:39.240
Wei Hao, Dynasty-Founding County Lord
of Pingyang, is here for an audience.

10:49.879 --> 10:50.600
Your Majesty,

10:50.600 --> 10:52.000
Lord Wei has arrived.

10:52.600 --> 10:53.600
Greetings, Your Majesty.

10:54.240 --> 10:55.039
You are here.

10:56.720 --> 10:59.000
You got up quite early today.

10:59.010 --> 11:00.990
Was it not arranged
for you to come in the morning?

11:01.440 --> 11:02.080
Well,

11:02.080 --> 11:03.240
my aunt got it wrong.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.399
The notice said morning,

11:04.440 --> 11:06.039
but she woke me before dawn.

11:06.420 --> 11:07.240
It is my first time.

11:07.240 --> 11:08.000
No experience.

11:11.639 --> 11:13.559
(Where have I heard that voice before?)

11:13.879 --> 11:15.080
(It sounds so familiar.)

11:15.200 --> 11:15.960
You may rise.

11:16.210 --> 11:17.159
Thank you, Your Majesty.

11:32.850 --> 11:35.680
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:36.300 --> 11:39.700
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:40.470 --> 11:43.420
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:43.760 --> 11:46.460
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:48.060 --> 11:51.530
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:51.530 --> 11:53.760
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:53.760 --> 11:55.870
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:55.870 --> 11:57.890
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:57.890 --> 12:02.250
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:03.690 --> 12:07.420
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

12:07.690 --> 12:11.290
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

12:11.450 --> 12:13.530
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

12:13.530 --> 12:18.320
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

12:18.540 --> 12:20.160
♪The world mistakes me♪

12:20.160 --> 12:22.500
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

12:22.570 --> 12:23.760
♪As the storm approaches♪

12:23.760 --> 12:26.160
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

12:26.370 --> 12:28.090
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

12:28.090 --> 12:30.070
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

12:30.240 --> 12:31.990
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:31.990 --> 12:34.090
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:34.090 --> 12:35.560
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:35.560 --> 12:37.790
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:38.010 --> 12:39.210
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:39.210 --> 12:41.730
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:41.860 --> 12:43.570
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:43.570 --> 12:44.850
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:45.000 --> 12:46.420
♪My wish has finally come true:♪

12:46.420 --> 12:47.460
♪To stay by your side♪

12:47.460 --> 12:49.380
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:49.550 --> 12:52.800
♪We are free and happy♪

12:56.800 --> 12:58.580
♪From a nobody♪

12:58.580 --> 13:00.480
♪To someone now famous♪

13:00.590 --> 13:02.020
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

13:02.020 --> 13:04.530
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

13:04.630 --> 13:06.210
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

13:06.210 --> 13:08.280
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

13:08.490 --> 13:10.170
♪In this vast world♪

13:10.170 --> 13:12.170
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

13:12.320 --> 13:14.530
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

13:14.530 --> 13:16.120
♪Everything ends eventually♪

13:16.210 --> 13:17.710
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

13:17.710 --> 13:20.110
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

13:20.110 --> 13:21.820
♪No matter how time flies♪

13:21.820 --> 13:22.980
♪Even if the falling snow♪

13:22.980 --> 13:24.610
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

13:24.610 --> 13:25.650
♪All I want now♪

13:25.650 --> 13:27.750
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

13:27.750 --> 13:31.010
♪Year after year♪
